// IntroString :
"P3676637568" "The boys at DATA have cooked up a new gadget they think may help us defeat the Clockwork. It's called the EMP Glove, and it sends out an electromagnetic pulse that should disrupt the robots' circuitry. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you test the EMP Glove on the Clockwork?</a> I'd recommend starting in Kings Row or Steel Canyon."
// AcceptString :
"P432314648" "Test EMP Glove on Clockwork"
// SendOffString :
"P835117143" "I'll be very interested to hear how this EMP Glove performs in the field."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1328105294" "I promised Professor St. John-Smythe some hard numbers. We need to know how that EMP Glove works against the Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2286300131" "Here's the EMP Glove."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2277015255" "You have collected enough data on the EMP Glove."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1221156850" "It's strange that the EMP Glove wasn't much more effective than your regular powers. I guess the DATA scientists will have to go back to the drawing board."

