"P3991612306" "I'm getting some disturbing reports about the Clockwork activity in Steel Canyon. It seems they're no longer content to scavenge from the streets. Now they're assaulting any citizen who happens to be wearing jewelry, a watch, or anything else metallic. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to stop the Clockwork assaults in Steel Canyon, {HeroName}.</A>"
